709                        ;************************************************************************
710                        ;   WRP_FLASH
711                        ;   This routine writes one 256-byte FLASH sector.
712                        ;   Each sector will contain 84 (24-bit) words from DSP RAM (252 bytes)
713                        ;   The last 4 bytes contain a 16-bit checksum of the data
714                        ;   followed by two blank bytes.
715                        ;
716                        ;   enter with:  r2 pointing to starting PEROM Byte Address from 56309 p.o.v.
717                        ;                r0 pointing to first DSP word to save
718                        ;
719                        ;   corrupts:    r0 - points to next P:memory location to save
720                        ;                r2 - points to next P:FLASH byte address to write
721                        ;                a,b,x0
722                        ;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
723    
724                        WRP_FLASH
725       P:002042 20001B            clr     b                                 ;initialize checksum
