811                        ;---------------------------------------------------------------------------
812                        ; delay_20m --
813                        ; 20.15 ms of delay guarantees that the write cycle has finished.
814                        ;
815                        ; For Write Pulse Width High to extend 150 us requires a minimum of
816                        ; 5100 Icycles for a 33.868 MHz clock.  (29.5 ns/Icycle)
817                        ;
818                        ; the tWC is 20ms, so we just wait long enough here for the
819                        ; write cycle to have started AND finished...
